<title>CANADA: CBRS upgrades Crown Life pfd shr rating.</title>
<headline>CBRS upgrades Crown Life pfd shr rating.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Bond Rating Service Inc said on Tuesday that it has upgraded Crown Life Insurance Co's preferred shares to P-3(High) from P-3.</p>
<p>The rating outlook has been maintained at stable.</p>
<p>Any further long-term upgrade will depend on Crown Life expanding its revenue base, the rating firm said .</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
